---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-28 relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14">
      <!-- Left: Section Title -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 reveal-left">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">About Me</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading" style="color: var(--text);">
          Engineering Data-Driven Solutions Through Empirical Analysis, Predictive Modeling, and Scalable BI.
        </h2>
        <div class="section-line"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Text Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 reveal-right">
        <div class="space-y-3.5 sm:space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
          <p>
            My analytics approach centers on a clear objective: converting fragmented data and complex operational metrics into decisive business leverage. Rather than relying on assumptions, I focus on diagnosing business bottlenecks and uncovering behavioral trends through disciplined statistical analysis and empirical modeling.
          </p>
          <p>
            My technical workflow spans the complete data lifecycle—from structuring and querying relational databases using <strong style="color: var(--text);">SQL</strong>, developing predictive machine learning models in <strong style="color: var(--text);">Python</strong>, to engineering automated analytical pipelines. To bridge the gap between technical output and executive execution, I design intuitive <strong style="color: var(--text);">Data Studio, Tableau & Power BI</strong> dashboards that provide actionable KPI visibility for decision-makers.
          </p>
          <p>
            Leveraging a strong foundation in enterprise workflows and academic mentoring in data mining, I build analytics solutions engineered to eliminate operational guesswork and deliver measurable business outcomes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Highlight tags -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 pt-5 sm:pt-7">
          {
            ["Python & Pandas", "SQL & Data Modeling", "Machine Learning", "Data Mining", "Predictive Analytics", "Data Studio", "Power BI", "Tableau"].map((item) => (
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
                style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, var(--bg-surface)); color: var(--accent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 25%, var(--border));"
              >
                {item}
              </span>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
